            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zapisz wartość <code>false</code> w zmiennej <code>status</code> i wyświetl <code>status</code> w konsoli.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Device charged&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(status)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Device charged\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>false</code>, a następnie <code>status</code>.</p></body></html>"
